  "sources": [
    {
      "type": "manual",
      "title": "minilogue MIDI Implementation (Revision 1.10, 2016.07.10)",
      "notes": "Tables read by tools/profiles/korg/read-korg-text.mjs from minilogue_MIDIimp_rev.txt (sha256 17b5eeccb1e99d9ecc9e3b0c6c9dc514b92832c28201b8520e5edd40a99df9c2), https://www.korg.com/us/support/download/manual/0/544/2890/. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
