  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/korg/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/korg/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a control change the document says the instrument recognises, or a row of its NRPN table, with its printed name. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "Not a parameter here, Bank Select, part of preset recall: CC 0, 32.",
    "Not a parameter here, a channel mode message: CC 120, 122, 123.",
    "Pull: CURRENT PROGRAM DATA DUMP REQUEST, answered by the current program in Korg's 8-in-7 packing (448Bytes = 7*64 -> 8*64 => 512Bytes). 38 parameter(s) are read back from it by the program table's offsets; a controller parameter reads the top seven bits of its 10-bit field, the value its controller sends.",
    "The exclusive header carries the global MIDI channel as 3g; the profile's deviceId variable is that byte, 30H for channel 1.",
    "In the program dump but not read back: DELAY OUTPUT ROUTING (the dump names a value \"PRE FILTER\" the parameter has no choice for).",
    "In the program dump with no parameter of the same name here: Amp Velocity, Portament Time, VOICE MODE, Bend Range (+), Bend Range (-), LFO Key Sync, LFO BPM Sync, LFO Voice Sync, Portament BPM, Portament Mode, Program Level, Slider Assign, KEYBOARD OCTAVE, BPM, Step Length, Swing, Default Gate Time, Step Resolution, Step 1 Off/On, Step 2 Off/On, Step 3 Off/On, Step 4 Off/On, Step 5 Off/On, Step 6 Off/On, Step 7 Off/On, Step 8 Off/On, Step 9 Off/On, Step 10 Off/On, Step 11 Off/On, Step 12 Off/On, Step 13 Off/On, Step 14 Off/On, Step 15 Off/On, Step 16 Off/On, Step, Motion Slot 1 Step 1 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 2 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 3 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 4 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 5 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 6 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 7 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 8 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 9 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 10 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 11 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 12 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 13 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 14 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 15 Off/On, Motion Slot 1 Step 16 Off/On."
  ],
